The K claims reconstruct and are non-vacuous, but the generated semantics incorrectly assumes unbounded recursion. For the valid input `"abc" * 400`, K proves `True` while the submitted Python raises `RecursionError`.

Detailed findings: [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md)  
Preserved scripts and logs: [evidence](/audit-output/evidence/)
